      "id": "macbeth/sceneIII_20.6/p@88863",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LORD.\nHe did: and with an absolute “Sir, not I,”\nThe cloudy messenger turns me his back,\nAnd hums, as who should say, “You’ll rue the time\nThat clogs me with this answer.”",
